<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine slides into Jan-Aug global trade deficit.</title>
<headline>Ukraine slides into Jan-Aug global trade deficit.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of</p>
<p>$585.3 million in the first eight months of this year, the</p>
<p>Statistics Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p> UKRAINIAN MERCHAANDISE TRADE   JAN-AUG 96   JAN-AUG 95</p>
<p> Exports (bln $)		    9.280	  6.791</p>
<p> Imports (bln $)		    9.865	  6.615</p>
<p> Balance (million $)	     -585.3	 +176.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for trade with all countries. Trade with the former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $992.4 million.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229-2264</p>
</text>
